# guard self-check mutation battery, 20260916T222238Z
# a surviving mutant means the self-check does not cover that invariant
killed    drop ^ anchor
killed    drop $ anchor
killed    drop owned-directory check
killed    drop .sock suffix check
killed    kind set gains a metacharacter
killed    kind set opened to .*
killed    drop pid binding
killed    uuid shape relaxed to .+
killed    kind set reverted to http only
SURVIVED  UNMUTATED control (must SURVIVE)
